# Which rule files each subagent receives, relative to agent-rules/.
# Read by hooks/subagent-rules.sh (Claude Code) and codex-config/gen.py (Codex).
#
# Every subagent definition in claude-config/agents/ sets `omitClaudeMd: true`,
# so a subagent does not load the main session's rules. A subagent listed here gets the
# files named on its line instead. A subagent not listed gets only its own
# definition.
#
# agent-type      rule files
ml-runner         kernel.md
emacs-probe       kernel.md craft/thinking.md team/thinker.md
memory-curator    kernel.md
